    3. For each rect, pick height h in [1,7] and width w in [1,5].
    4. Place rects so their bottom edges are all at row 14, columns non-overlapping with gaps >= 1.
       Sort rects by column. Total column span (sum of widths + gaps) must fit within 15 cols.
    5. Validate clearance: for each rect at columns [c0,c1] with top row r0=15-h,
       the h rows above [r0-h, r0-1] in those columns must be background.
       Since columns don't overlap, this is automatically satisfied.
    6. Validate dest_top >= 0: r0 - h >= 0 means 15 - 2*h >= 0, i.e. h <= 7.
